{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12227110","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12227110","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1222711001:1":{"text":"잭슨, 우리가 뭘 낚았는지 보세요!","source_cn":"约克逊，你看我们钓到了什么！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C2D194C2EB91A08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:2::0":{"text":"골든 피콕","source_cn":"黄金孔雀","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x508EF0BB02A5AC0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1222711002:1":{"text":"금빛으로 빛나는 이 몸, 물결치는 것 같은 긴 꼬리... 정말 골든 피콕이군요!","source_cn":"艾雅女神显灵……这通体金黄的鱼身，这摇曳的长尾……真的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1E78A705BE67C2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222711003:1":{"text":"대체 어떻게 낚으신 겁니까?","source_cn":"你们是怎么钓上它的？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF94B3ED915ADF2F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1222711003":{"text":"대체 어떻게 낚으신 겁니까?","source_cn":"你们是怎么钓上它的？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF94B3ED915ADF2F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222711004:1":{"text":"제가 알고 있는 것과 비슷한데... 특별한 점은 없었나요?","source_cn":"听起来和我知道的线索差不多……就没有什么特别的地方吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC04C83F0B8655822","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222711005:0":{"text":"음, 골드를 미끼로 쓰지 않았다는 점이 특별하다면 특별하겠죠?","source_cn":"唔，我们没有使用金币作为鱼饵算不算？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8E8826463B1CF56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222711006:0":{"text":"...네!? 평범한 미끼를 썼다고요?!","source_cn":"——什么？！你们只用了普通的鱼饵？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF3463F797573BC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222711007:1":{"text":"이건 제가 알고 있는 골든 피콕의 습성과는 달라요... 어부들이 분명 골드만 먹는다고 말했는데...","source_cn":"这和我了解的黄金孔雀的习性不太一样，渔夫们都说它只吃金币……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFF10E429C05EBA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222711008:1":{"text":"안 되겠어요. 제대로 연구를 해봐야 할 것 같네요! 그렇지 않으면 상록수 학회의 학자 정신이 부끄러울 거예요!","source_cn":"不行，我得好好研究一下！否则就太对不起冬青学会的学者精神了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A8C7ABBD3478F3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1222711009:1":{"text":"실례가 안 된다면 혹시 물고기를 잠시 빌려주실 수 있을까요?","source_cn":"虽然有些冒昧，但我能不能借这条鱼一看？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFD821FD5EBF078C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1222711009":{"text":"실례가 안 된다면 혹시 물고기를 잠시 빌려주실 수 있을까요?","source_cn":"虽然有些冒昧，但我能不能借这条鱼一看？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFD821FD5EBF078C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1222711011:1":{"text":"어떤 방법으로 실험해야 할지 고민해 봐야겠네요...","source_cn":"让我想想，我得找个法子试验一下……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x893584B74F416925","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:16:1222711012:1":{"text":"잠시 실험을 한 뒤, 잭슨은 골든 피콕을 돌려주었다.","source_cn":"","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF4490B75294EDB4B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"잠시 실험을 한 뒤, 잭슨은 골든 피콕을 돌려주었다.","female":"잠시 실험을 한 뒤, 잭슨은 골든 피콕을 돌려주었다.","variant_male_record_index":"141560","variant_female_record_index":"141561","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1222711013:1":{"text":"실험 결과는 어때요?","source_cn":"怎么样？试验有什么结果吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF6EFFF2226A8333","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1222711014:1":{"text":"...시간도 표본도 너무 부족해서 확실한 결론을 내릴 수 없었어요.","source_cn":"……时间太短，样本量也不够，得不到确切的结论。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3209C52C81D5516","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1222711015:1":{"text":"결국 직접 골든 피콕을 낚아서 장기적으로 관찰하고 연구하는 수밖에 없겠네요.","source_cn":"果然还是得自己钓一条黄金孔雀，进行长期观察和研究才行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53A1E4EE0E33F2B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1222711016:1":{"text":"그래도 여러분 덕분에 골든 피콕을 낚을 수 있다는 희망을 갖게 되었어요! 이 선물을 받아주세요. ","source_cn":"不过也要多谢你们，让我看到了钓到它的希望！这份礼物就请...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD890A9CE21743F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:0:1":{"text":"물론이지","source_cn":"当然可以","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC92DB85FDB6D2502","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"물론이지","female":"물론이지","variant_male_record_index":"67946","variant_female_record_index":"67947","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1222711010:1":{"text":"이봐요, 상록수 학회는 강도질 같은 건 안 한다고요!","source_cn":"嘿，我们冬青学会可不会做出那种强盗行为！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBBB7E1AFB0D8CAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:1:2":{"text":"돌려주는 거지?","source_cn":"你会还给我的吧？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8